# Generated artifacts.
#
# Ignored by default, with the evidence-bearing ones exempted below. The distinction is whether the
# artifact records something a reader cannot reproduce alone: a measurement of an external chain is
# evidence and belongs in the repository, a test run's output is not.
#
# A clean-room clone found this: everything under artifacts/ was ignored, so two artifacts the test
# suite asserts on never reached a fresh checkout and `make test` failed there while passing here.
artifacts/
!artifacts/oracles/
!artifacts/oracles/**
!artifacts/evidence/
!artifacts/evidence/**
# Content-addressed evidence store. Original bytes live under services/evidence/fixtures/ where
# they are manifested and hash-verified; this is a working cache, not the record.
services/evidence/.store/
coverage/
lcov.info
.DS_Store
*.log

# Test / tooling
playwright-report/
test-results/
.turbo/

